1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,000
The Clover Kingdom.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,000
In this place where magic is everything,

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,000
there lives one boy who was born without it.

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,000
His name is Asta.

5
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:15,000
His strength and determination helped him become a magic knight.

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
And despite the many challenges he faces,

7
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,000
he aims for the top and refuses to give up.

8
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Rich or poor, royalty or commoner,

9
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Asta believes anyone can shine.

10
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:32,000
His mission is to prove that to the whole world

11
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:36,000
and to become the next Wizard King.

12
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Asta and the others traveled to the Heart Kingdom

13
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:41,000
to learn more about the Devil's curse.

14
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:43,000
But Asta was abducted,

15
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:45,000
leaving Noelle, Mimosa and Finral

16
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:48,000
to do battle with the spirit guardian, Gaja.

17
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Meanwhile, Asta was forced into a confrontation as well

18
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:55,000
against a powerful water spirit by the name of Undine.

19
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:57,000
You may address me as Undine.

20
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:59,000
I'm one of the four great spirits

21
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:02,000
and I'm contracted to the Queen of the Heart Kingdom.

22
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:06,000
Andine and Gaja both presented serious challenges

23
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:08,000
for Asta and his companions.

24
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:09,000
But...

25
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:12,000
Sealing magic, inverse relief!

26
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:13,000
Here's the deal!

27
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:16,000
We can't just back down after watching you show up!

28
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Mind if I join you?!

29
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:22,000
I have a real soul.'"

30
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:35,000
Coolzentical music

31
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:37,000
I love you!

32
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:39,000
I want you to play together today!

33
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:42,280
Yeah yeah

34
00:01:42,280 --> 00:01:50,800
強く風吹く世界の果てで

35
00:01:50,800 --> 00:01:56,260
僕らは今日も目を閉じる夢を見る飽きもせず

36
00:01:56,260 --> 00:02:01,740
今は小さく儚い希望も

37
00:02:01,740 --> 00:02:07,060
いつか時代を変えてゆく光になると信じて

38
00:02:07,060 --> 00:02:11,720
背負うべきものなど何一つないさ

39
00:02:11,720 --> 00:02:14,560
全て抱きしめてゆく

40
00:02:14,560 --> 00:02:19,020
例えばそれが痛みだとしても

41
00:02:19,020 --> 00:02:23,700
叶うなら君と共に

42
00:02:23,700 --> 00:02:31,160
この声がこの喉が擦り切れるほど今叫ぶよ

43
00:02:31,160 --> 00:02:35,520
未来は自分で切り開くんだって

44
00:02:35,520 --> 00:02:40,180
とめとなく溢れ出る情熱のままさ

45
00:02:40,180 --> 00:02:42,180
歩き出そう

46
00:02:42,180 --> 00:02:47,180
To save my dream

47
00:02:47,180 --> 00:02:58,840
ご視聴ありがとうございました

48
00:02:58,840 --> 00:03:00,980
That's weird

49
00:03:00,980 --> 00:03:04,500
I could have sworn I sensed somebody's key here

50
00:03:04,500 --> 00:03:11,500
Hey

51
00:03:11,500 --> 00:03:12,280
Hey

52
00:03:12,280 --> 00:03:14,780
Oh my gosh I am so sorry

53
00:03:14,780 --> 00:03:17,880
This thick beaver pelt just felt so nice and soft on my skin

54
00:03:17,880 --> 00:03:23,160
What was that for?

55
00:03:23,160 --> 00:03:29,440
Oh where did my glasses go?

56
00:03:30,160 --> 00:03:32,440
Laura Pechka?

57
00:03:32,680 --> 00:03:34,580
What in the world are you up to now?

58
00:03:34,580 --> 00:03:37,400
I told you to hurry up and change out of your pajamas

59
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:38,500
We have guests

60
00:03:38,500 --> 00:03:39,480
Right

61
00:03:39,480 --> 00:03:40,520
I apologize

62
00:03:40,520 --> 00:03:46,220
So that girl's the queen of the heart kingdom?

63
00:03:52,240 --> 00:03:55,140
I only survive thanks to my defensive spell

64
00:03:55,140 --> 00:03:58,620
It appears she was holding back

65
00:03:58,620 --> 00:04:00,240
What a great talent

66
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:02,060
As for the others

67
00:04:02,060 --> 00:04:11,480
He's so fast

68
00:04:11,480 --> 00:04:14,500
Please forgive my rudeness

69
00:04:14,500 --> 00:04:17,320
I forced you into a battle with me

70
00:04:17,320 --> 00:04:19,780
So that I could accurately judge your magic stages

71
00:04:19,780 --> 00:04:21,280
Uh

72
00:04:21,280 --> 00:04:23,180
Magic stages?

73
00:04:23,800 --> 00:04:25,640
Is that the scale I heard about before?

74
00:04:26,080 --> 00:04:27,320
Where the smaller the number is

75
00:04:27,320 --> 00:04:28,540
The more capable you are?

76
00:04:29,820 --> 00:04:30,220
Yes

77
00:04:30,220 --> 00:04:32,200
Here strength is judged by magic power

78
00:04:32,200 --> 00:04:33,500
Not the number of bows

79
00:04:33,500 --> 00:04:35,040
For example

80
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:37,220
If there was one mage ranked very high on the scale

81
00:04:37,220 --> 00:04:39,820
He might be victorious against dozens of lesser opponents

82
00:04:39,820 --> 00:04:41,520
At the same time

83
00:04:41,520 --> 00:04:43,440
So in a war between magical nations

84
00:04:43,440 --> 00:04:47,480
Each side is generally judged by the magic stages of their military forces

85
00:04:47,480 --> 00:04:49,240
More specifically

86
00:04:49,240 --> 00:04:54,140
A kingdom's power is typically determined by the number of mages it has who are ranked near stage zero

87
00:04:54,140 --> 00:04:55,420
Of course

88
00:04:55,420 --> 00:04:57,240
If it's a devil you're dealing with

89
00:04:57,240 --> 00:05:00,160
Any fighter who's lower than stage one won't be able to hold their own

90
00:05:00,160 --> 00:05:00,900
A devil?

91
00:05:02,240 --> 00:05:03,380
That's why we're here

92
00:05:03,380 --> 00:05:04,340
The thing is

93
00:05:04,340 --> 00:05:06,900
We came because we picked up a huge curse signal

94
00:05:06,900 --> 00:05:08,720
And a devil's gotta be the cause of it

95
00:05:08,720 --> 00:05:12,980
How did they find out something only spirit guardians should know?

96
00:05:13,840 --> 00:05:16,220
Can you guys tell us anything about devil curses?

97
00:05:17,100 --> 00:05:18,380
Always so direct

98
00:05:18,380 --> 00:05:20,280
Unfortunately for you

99
00:05:20,280 --> 00:05:22,100
No one will ever talk about them

100
00:05:22,100 --> 00:05:23,480
Actually

101
00:05:23,480 --> 00:05:26,300
I happen to suffer from a devil curse myself

102
00:05:26,300 --> 00:05:28,460
If nothing's done about it

103
00:05:28,460 --> 00:05:30,140
I'll be dead within a year or so

104
00:05:30,140 --> 00:05:32,340
Honestly!

105
00:05:32,340 --> 00:05:33,340
Why?

106
00:05:34,660 --> 00:05:36,420
Why would you tell them that, fool?

107
00:05:37,460 --> 00:05:37,580
Huh?

108
00:05:40,260 --> 00:05:41,740
Oh sweet Laura Petchka

109
00:05:41,740 --> 00:05:44,360
That adorable ignorance of yours will be the end of me one day

110
00:05:44,360 --> 00:05:45,180
I just know it

111
00:05:45,180 --> 00:05:47,200
It's true

112
00:05:47,200 --> 00:05:50,420
The reason we brought the two of you to this place against your will

113
00:05:50,420 --> 00:05:52,100
And tried to discern your magic stages

114
00:05:52,100 --> 00:05:55,100
Is because we desire to defeat Megicula

115
00:05:55,100 --> 00:05:57,680
The devil who cast this curse

116
00:05:57,680 --> 00:06:02,300
Clearly you stand to benefit from this as well

117
00:06:02,300 --> 00:06:05,100
So, residents of the Clover Kingdom

118
00:06:05,100 --> 00:06:06,980
Please join us

119
00:06:06,980 --> 00:06:08,460
Yeah?

120
00:06:08,700 --> 00:06:09,400
What's wrong?

121
00:06:09,840 --> 00:06:10,480
Excuse me

122
00:06:10,480 --> 00:06:12,860
I forgot to water the poplata trees

123
00:06:12,860 --> 00:06:13,660
Really?

124
00:06:14,780 --> 00:06:17,720
I'm pretty sure we were in the middle of a life and death conversation here

125
00:06:17,720 --> 00:06:19,480
But hey, do what you gotta do, I guess

126
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:21,660
If this is the way their queen behaves

127
00:06:21,660 --> 00:06:23,260
Then I'm very concerned about them

128
00:06:23,260 --> 00:06:44,080
Whoa, this is so crazy

129
00:06:44,080 --> 00:06:46,000
Okay, here you go

130
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:47,560
Drink up

131
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:52,100
Oh my

132
00:06:52,100 --> 00:06:54,620
The Zozo squirrels are as energetic as ever

133
00:06:54,620 --> 00:06:55,480
Uh-oh

134
00:06:55,480 --> 00:06:56,540
Slow down there, Michele

135
00:06:56,540 --> 00:06:58,320
It's dangerous if you run too quickly

136
00:06:58,320 --> 00:07:02,040
It looks like old man Kakalos' cop is starting to clear up now

137
00:07:02,040 --> 00:07:05,780
And look, the total fruits are growing so splendidly as well

138
00:07:05,780 --> 00:07:08,160
It's good to see everything going smoothly

139
00:07:08,160 --> 00:07:10,320
She's watering the whole place at once

140
00:07:10,320 --> 00:07:13,020
She sees the entire kingdom at a glance

141
00:07:13,020 --> 00:07:15,580
And single-handedly controls the water

142
00:07:15,580 --> 00:07:19,000
She has an all-encompassing warmth about her

143
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:22,340
So no living thing in her domain goes uncared for

144
00:07:22,340 --> 00:07:26,500
This magic is fitting for the queen of the Heart Kingdom

145
00:07:26,500 --> 00:07:28,340
Now, now, Laura Petschka

146
00:07:28,340 --> 00:07:31,480
How about we change you into more appropriate attire?

147
00:07:32,120 --> 00:07:36,720
You see, our current ruler has inherited the ability of most of the queens who've gone before her

148
00:07:36,720 --> 00:07:40,360
She's our beautiful kingdom's guardian deity

149
00:07:40,360 --> 00:07:42,340
The all-knowing priestess

150
00:07:42,340 --> 00:07:48,340
Therefore, we simply cannot lose someone as precious as her to a devil's curse

151
00:07:48,340 --> 00:07:50,340
There is no one else like her

152
00:07:50,340 --> 00:07:57,640
That's better

153
00:07:57,640 --> 00:08:00,540
You're quite pretty when you put in the effort, you know

154
00:08:00,540 --> 00:08:02,880
Oh, it's hard to walk in this

155
00:08:02,880 --> 00:08:08,100
Come on!

156
00:08:08,480 --> 00:08:10,100
What am I going to do with you?

157
00:08:10,720 --> 00:08:11,840
Hey, I get it

158
00:08:11,840 --> 00:08:14,720
The clumsiness must be part of the devil's curse too, huh?

159
00:08:15,020 --> 00:08:16,900
Oh no, I'm just naturally a klutz

160
00:08:16,900 --> 00:08:18,900
Wow, that's bad!

161
00:08:20,020 --> 00:08:20,580
Megicula

162
00:08:20,580 --> 00:08:24,100
That loathsome devil who cursed my dear Laura Petschka

163
00:08:24,100 --> 00:08:26,960
Is currently in the Diamond Kingdom

164
00:08:26,960 --> 00:08:36,880
We came to scout the Diamond Kingdom to be safe

165
00:08:36,880 --> 00:08:38,200
What happened?

166
00:08:44,680 --> 00:08:47,760
He wiped out all of those Diamond soldiers on his own

167
00:08:47,760 --> 00:08:50,500
And some of them were as tough as our captains

168
00:08:50,500 --> 00:08:52,120
Who is this guy?

169
00:08:56,960 --> 00:08:59,260
Don't you go getting any bright ideas, Luck

170
00:08:59,260 --> 00:09:01,300
As much as I hate to admit it

171
00:09:01,300 --> 00:09:03,200
I've never felt like this in my whole life

172
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:04,960
Believe it or not

173
00:09:04,960 --> 00:09:07,460
I don't want to fight this guy

174
00:09:20,500 --> 00:09:26,180
I'm so relieved that you're safe

175
00:09:26,180 --> 00:09:27,160
You're the worst

176
00:09:27,160 --> 00:09:28,680
Stop getting kidnapped

177
00:09:28,680 --> 00:09:30,880
It's starting to get really old

178
00:09:30,880 --> 00:09:33,720
Her Majesty the Queen is here

179
00:09:33,720 --> 00:09:46,380
She's so majestic

180
00:09:46,380 --> 00:09:49,540
And the magic that she possesses is immeasurable

181
00:09:49,540 --> 00:09:53,060
So that's the Queen of the Heart Kingdom

182
00:09:53,060 --> 00:09:56,060
Wow, talk about a treat for the eyes

183
00:09:56,060 --> 00:09:59,980
How lucky am I to be in the presence of such an exceptional goddess

184
00:09:59,980 --> 00:10:01,700
Wait, stop it, Finral

185
00:10:01,700 --> 00:10:03,420
You're supposed to be better than that

186
00:10:03,420 --> 00:10:05,340
You're a one-woman man from now on

187
00:10:05,340 --> 00:10:07,200
Remember, get it together, would you?

188
00:10:07,200 --> 00:10:07,880
What's going on?

189
00:10:08,300 --> 00:10:09,280
Is Finral okay?

190
00:10:09,980 --> 00:10:10,440
Nope

191
00:10:10,440 --> 00:10:13,000
Residents of the Clover Kingdom

192
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:17,280
I humbly ask that you lend your strength to us

193
00:10:17,280 --> 00:10:21,300
Really?

194
00:10:21,800 --> 00:10:23,500
Come now, Laura Petchka

195
00:10:23,500 --> 00:10:25,920
Do try to behave more like a queen

196
00:10:25,920 --> 00:10:27,500
Oh, a nosebleed

197
00:10:27,500 --> 00:10:29,180
Aw, you're still adorable

198
00:10:29,180 --> 00:10:33,800
What happened?

199
00:10:33,800 --> 00:10:36,320
I got blood on my dress

200
00:10:36,320 --> 00:10:37,380
Of course

201
00:10:37,380 --> 00:10:39,040
All right, give me a moment

202
00:10:39,040 --> 00:10:43,360
This is precisely why I was so against her conducting this meeting in person

203
00:10:43,360 --> 00:10:48,320
I guess now that that's over

204
00:10:48,320 --> 00:10:50,180
What did you need our help with?

205
00:10:50,180 --> 00:10:54,300
I was under the impression that the Heart Kingdom had plenty of mages at Stage 1 or higher

206
00:10:54,300 --> 00:10:55,900
Not to mention the Spirit Guardians

207
00:10:55,900 --> 00:10:57,160
So what can we do?

208
00:10:58,000 --> 00:10:59,860
As I explained, when battling a devil

209
00:10:59,860 --> 00:11:03,640
Every mage involved needs to be ranked at least Stage 1 in order to keep up

210
00:11:03,640 --> 00:11:05,040
But even a Zero

211
00:11:05,040 --> 00:11:08,180
Still wouldn't have what it takes to achieve victory

212
00:11:08,180 --> 00:11:15,300
You see, Spirit Guardians are able to wield powerful magic by borrowing energy from natural mana

213
00:11:15,300 --> 00:11:17,620
But they cannot defeat a devil

214
00:11:17,620 --> 00:11:22,000
Unlike us, your kingdom created magic types that are not derived from nature

215
00:11:22,000 --> 00:11:25,280
Such as chain, steel, and the eccentric spatial magic

216
00:11:25,280 --> 00:11:28,940
In exchange, they lose the divine protection of natural mana

217
00:11:28,940 --> 00:11:33,200
And some of the Irregulars who were born in that environment

218
00:11:33,200 --> 00:11:35,760
Have the necessary traits to best a devil

219
00:11:35,760 --> 00:11:41,800
One example of this is Julius Nova Crono who possesses time magic

220
00:11:41,800 --> 00:11:46,180
There is also the Black Bull's Captain Yamisuke Hiro and his dark magic

221
00:11:46,180 --> 00:11:52,320
Unfortunately, it appears the majority of Julius' power has been used up at this point

222
00:11:52,320 --> 00:11:54,660
She knows about that?

223
00:11:55,080 --> 00:11:57,320
I wonder how much information she has

224
00:11:57,320 --> 00:11:59,060
And you

225
00:11:59,060 --> 00:12:01,360
Asta and Nero

226
00:12:01,360 --> 00:12:06,200
For combat, Nero's about a Stage 6

227
00:12:06,200 --> 00:12:10,160
But she's got ancient sealing magic and is used for Bidden Magic

228
00:12:10,160 --> 00:12:12,620
Asta has no mana

229
00:12:12,620 --> 00:12:16,200
But because of that, he was granted the use of Anti-Magic

230
00:12:16,200 --> 00:12:24,860
People like you two who possess unique, inexplicable powers are referred to as Arcane Stages

231
00:12:24,860 --> 00:12:28,900
So... we're...

232
00:12:28,900 --> 00:12:33,020
I would like you to lend us your Arcane powers to help us defeat that devil

233
00:12:33,020 --> 00:12:37,320
And as a reward, I will happily share any information that I have with you

234
00:12:37,320 --> 00:12:41,060
But we don't have the authority to make a major decision like that

235
00:12:41,060 --> 00:12:43,720
Good thing we've got this magic item then, huh?

236
00:12:43,720 --> 00:12:47,180
I'm taking a dump here

237
00:12:47,180 --> 00:12:50,460
Oh, you have something important to ask me?

238
00:12:50,880 --> 00:12:53,520
Well, I happen to be doing something important myself

239
00:12:53,520 --> 00:12:56,220
In fact, this could be one for the history books

240
00:12:56,220 --> 00:12:57,960
Call back later

241
00:12:57,960 --> 00:13:00,160
He just hung up on me

242
00:13:00,160 --> 00:13:01,440
Pooping is crucial

243
00:13:01,440 --> 00:13:02,800
You're on his side?

244
00:13:03,180 --> 00:13:06,140
You mustn't say such vulgar things, Laura Petchka

245
00:13:06,140 --> 00:13:10,660
Well, I had my suspicions that something like this would happen

246
00:13:10,660 --> 00:13:14,740
So I borrowed a magic item that allows us to connect with the transmission magic that Marx uses

247
00:13:14,740 --> 00:13:15,560
Good thinking

248
00:13:15,560 --> 00:13:16,960
Nice one, Mimosa

249
00:13:16,960 --> 00:13:19,080
Alright, let's try it out

250
00:13:19,080 --> 00:13:22,560
Mimosa, did something happen?

251
00:13:22,560 --> 00:13:25,620
Wait, is that who I think it is?

252
00:13:25,780 --> 00:13:28,020
Oh, wow, you must be the Queen of Heart Kingdom

253
00:13:28,020 --> 00:13:30,140
So what kind of magic do you use?

254
00:13:30,700 --> 00:13:33,000
Please don't pop into a frame like that, Your Majesty

255
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:35,360
Have you forgotten about your condition?

256
00:13:35,940 --> 00:13:36,760
People will see

257
00:13:36,760 --> 00:13:39,260
Well, you just called me Your Majesty

258
00:13:39,260 --> 00:13:40,500
So now they know it's me

259
00:13:40,500 --> 00:13:40,920
Huh?

260
00:13:42,320 --> 00:13:43,400
That's no big deal

261
00:13:43,400 --> 00:13:44,520
The Queen already knew

262
00:13:44,520 --> 00:13:45,280
What?

263
00:13:46,980 --> 00:13:47,960
So, anyway

264
00:13:47,960 --> 00:13:50,520
She says they need our help to beat a devil

265
00:13:50,520 --> 00:13:52,960
Because we're arcane stager or something like that

266
00:13:52,960 --> 00:13:54,440
That's fine by me

267
00:13:54,440 --> 00:13:57,540
You and your friends could gain something amazing from all this

268
00:13:57,540 --> 00:14:00,760
Honestly, I think I'd like to be over there helping you myself

269
00:14:00,760 --> 00:14:02,220
That's out of the question

270
00:14:02,220 --> 00:14:04,280
I suppose that settles it then

271
00:14:04,280 --> 00:14:05,500
How wonderful

272
00:14:05,500 --> 00:14:08,680
Then again, if you tried to fight a devil in your current state

273
00:14:08,680 --> 00:14:10,720
You would all be slaughtered in the blink of an eye

274
00:14:10,720 --> 00:14:12,420
That's kind of blunt

275
00:14:12,420 --> 00:14:17,320
I mean, is the spade devil really supposed to be that impossible to take down?

276
00:14:17,920 --> 00:14:18,280
Yes

277
00:14:18,280 --> 00:14:21,600
Even more deadly than the devil you fought with previously

278
00:14:21,600 --> 00:14:23,640
Worse than him?

279
00:14:24,760 --> 00:14:28,180
We only won that time because we had help from super powerful people

280
00:14:28,180 --> 00:14:30,540
Like the first wizard king and the leader of the elves

281
00:14:30,540 --> 00:14:32,780
And even then it was a close call

282
00:14:32,780 --> 00:14:36,400
Megicula is responsible for the scar on Gaja's face

283
00:14:36,400 --> 00:14:36,960
What?

284
00:14:37,260 --> 00:14:39,820
But we barely stood a chance against that guy before

285
00:14:39,820 --> 00:14:46,520
Ah yes, I remember dueling with that spirit guardian fellow in the past

286
00:14:46,520 --> 00:14:47,860
He's extremely skilled

287
00:14:47,860 --> 00:14:48,840
You guys fought?

288
00:14:49,480 --> 00:14:54,420
So even someone the wizard king speaks that highly of isn't able to defeat this devil?

289
00:14:56,200 --> 00:14:58,680
The way we are now, we can't win

290
00:14:58,680 --> 00:15:00,940
We have to get stronger

291
00:15:00,940 --> 00:15:04,540
Megicula is currently haunting the spade kingdom

292
00:15:04,540 --> 00:15:08,300
And using its citizens to gather up enormous amounts of power

293
00:15:08,300 --> 00:15:14,920
Soon, that devil could invade and conquer not only the heart kingdom

294
00:15:14,920 --> 00:15:17,080
But clover and diamond as well

295
00:15:17,080 --> 00:15:20,660
If nothing changes

296
00:15:20,660 --> 00:15:23,560
Then I will eventually be killed by this curse

297
00:15:23,560 --> 00:15:28,400
That's why I'd like to invade the spade kingdom before my power becomes too weak

298
00:15:28,400 --> 00:15:32,060
We can take half a year

299
00:15:32,060 --> 00:15:35,280
Let's make our forces as strong as we can

300
00:15:35,280 --> 00:15:40,100
We should enlist any mages who stand a chance in battle against a devil

301
00:15:40,100 --> 00:15:41,980
Train for six months

302
00:15:41,980 --> 00:15:45,200
Then we will fight together to stop Megicula

303
00:15:45,200 --> 00:15:47,140
If you help us

304
00:15:47,140 --> 00:15:48,560
We can do it!

305
00:15:48,560 --> 00:15:58,440
Sir, are you certain you approve of this?

306
00:15:59,700 --> 00:16:00,180
Remember

307
00:16:00,180 --> 00:16:03,700
The magic knights are still exhausted from fighting the elves

308
00:16:03,700 --> 00:16:05,920
It's true that we have half a year

309
00:16:05,920 --> 00:16:07,520
But this is a devil

310
00:16:07,520 --> 00:16:09,520
Just think of the casualties

311
00:16:09,520 --> 00:16:11,420
For clover and for heart

312
00:16:11,420 --> 00:16:15,660
I take it you heard the report from the scouts we sent out, Marks?

313
00:16:15,660 --> 00:16:18,780
Considering the state diamond is in

314
00:16:18,780 --> 00:16:22,260
Our only hope is to have our magic knights improve their skills

315
00:16:22,260 --> 00:16:26,220
I'm sure the queen of the heart kingdom knows that as well

316
00:16:26,220 --> 00:16:28,120
I guess you're right

317
00:16:28,120 --> 00:16:31,440
Assemble all of the magic knight squad captains

318
00:16:31,440 --> 00:16:33,240
Sir!

319
00:16:40,140 --> 00:16:42,720
How long is Captain Yami gonna make us wait?

320
00:16:43,120 --> 00:16:45,140
We've got a major announcement to make here

321
00:16:45,140 --> 00:16:47,520
Keep your voice down, you little shrimp

322
00:16:47,520 --> 00:16:51,460
We all know that the captain can't do his business if he doesn't have peace and quiet

323
00:16:51,460 --> 00:16:52,800
Pooping again?

324
00:16:55,120 --> 00:16:56,000
Whew, Nelly

325
00:16:56,000 --> 00:16:58,880
Wait a minute, don't tell me you've been in there since we called you

326
00:16:58,880 --> 00:17:00,620
The war's not over yet

327
00:17:00,620 --> 00:17:03,560
Trust me, I'd love to kick back and celebrate today's victory

328
00:17:03,560 --> 00:17:06,280
But the next battle's already starting to rear its ugly head

329
00:17:06,280 --> 00:17:08,340
Metaphors or not, it's still gross

330
00:17:08,340 --> 00:17:12,100
Well, anyway, let's hear what went down during your visit to the heart kingdom

331
00:17:12,100 --> 00:17:13,320
Oh, yes sir

332
00:17:13,320 --> 00:17:16,080
It was so eventful, I'm not sure where to begin

333
00:17:16,080 --> 00:17:16,980
Get this!

334
00:17:17,540 --> 00:17:20,800
We found out who was cursed by a devil over there and it's the queen of all people!

335
00:17:20,880 --> 00:17:21,800
Pretty crazy, right?

336
00:17:22,360 --> 00:17:25,840
And if the curse isn't broken soon, then she's only got a year to live

337
00:17:25,840 --> 00:17:31,340
Since she was chosen by one of the four great spirits, she's the most powerful mage they've got

338
00:17:31,340 --> 00:17:34,220
If they lose someone like that, they're in big trouble

339
00:17:34,220 --> 00:17:40,060
Obviously we should keep all that on the down low

340
00:17:40,060 --> 00:17:44,060
I hope you at least got a little bit of useful information on the devil, too

341
00:17:44,060 --> 00:17:47,160
We have a name, Megicula

342
00:17:47,160 --> 00:17:50,100
And a location, in the Spade Kingdom

343
00:17:50,100 --> 00:17:51,320
In Spade?

344
00:17:52,200 --> 00:17:55,020
If that's really true, then what we saw makes a lot of sense

345
00:17:55,020 --> 00:17:57,680
Huh? Did you guys find something weird?

346
00:17:58,320 --> 00:18:03,180
Apparently when they went to check out the Diamond Kingdom, they ran into one of Spade's mages close to the border

347
00:18:03,180 --> 00:18:04,320
Whoa, really?

348
00:18:05,280 --> 00:18:08,480
Except, he wasn't just a normal mage

349
00:18:08,480 --> 00:18:12,120
There were hundreds of Diamond soldiers on the ground

350
00:18:12,120 --> 00:18:15,460
He beat them all by himself like it was nothing

351
00:18:15,460 --> 00:18:18,180
And that cold, dark magic he had

352
00:18:18,180 --> 00:18:20,760
I wouldn't be surprised if he got it from a devil

353
00:18:20,760 --> 00:18:28,580
I don't know if it's possible, but I wonder if we might have seen Megicula without even realizing it

354
00:18:28,580 --> 00:18:32,100
Oh no, if that's him, then the Diamond Kingdom is...

355
00:18:32,100 --> 00:18:35,060
Pretty much done for, all because of that one guy

356
00:18:35,060 --> 00:18:42,060
But Mars...

357
00:18:42,060 --> 00:18:45,860
Even from that distance, one thing was obvious

358
00:18:45,860 --> 00:18:48,180
That man could have easily killed us

359
00:18:48,180 --> 00:18:52,700
If we had picked to fight with him, we'd have suffered the same fate as those Diamond soldiers

360
00:18:52,700 --> 00:18:55,100
Yeah, you're not tough enough yet

361
00:18:55,100 --> 00:19:00,200
If we can't defeat that devil, then both the Heart Kingdom and the Clover Kingdom are going to be history

362
00:19:00,200 --> 00:19:04,660
So the only solution is to try to get stronger

363
00:19:04,660 --> 00:19:07,780
The Queen told us to spend six months training

364
00:19:07,780 --> 00:19:11,660
And after that, the Heart Kingdom will launch their attack on the Spade Kingdom

365
00:19:11,660 --> 00:19:17,320
As Magic Knights, it's our job to spend every minute of the next six months getting as powerful as we can

366
00:19:17,320 --> 00:19:21,280
And then we'll be able to help them defeat Megicula and keep everybody safe

367
00:19:21,280 --> 00:19:22,520
One thing

368
00:19:22,520 --> 00:19:23,820
What is it, Sora?

369
00:19:24,580 --> 00:19:27,940
Just so we're clear, are you sure training is all we have to do?

370
00:19:28,040 --> 00:19:30,620
Because beating a devil is hard even for the best of us

371
00:19:30,620 --> 00:19:34,380
Unless we're Stage 1 mages or higher, we won't even be able to keep up

372
00:19:34,380 --> 00:19:37,380
To put that into terms that we're more familiar with

373
00:19:37,380 --> 00:19:39,960
That would be like a first-class Senior Magic Knight

374
00:19:39,960 --> 00:19:43,500
No, even that wouldn't be good enough in this situation

375
00:19:43,500 --> 00:19:48,780
Wait a minute, are you telling us we have to get up to a Vice-Captain's level in just six months?

376
00:19:49,000 --> 00:19:50,900
Heh, easier said than done

377
00:19:50,900 --> 00:19:56,300
Unfortunately, as far as we know, the only people in our Kingdom who stand a chance of defeating the Devil

378
00:19:56,300 --> 00:19:58,980
Are mages whose power lands them in the Arcane Stage

379
00:19:58,980 --> 00:20:01,920
Including Asta, Nero, Captain Yami, and the Wizard King

380
00:20:01,920 --> 00:20:04,920
Well, whether I have what it takes or not, I refuse to give up

381
00:20:04,920 --> 00:20:06,300
We can all get there eventually

382
00:20:06,300 --> 00:20:07,380
Right?

383
00:20:08,200 --> 00:20:09,020
I have to

384
00:20:09,020 --> 00:20:11,600
Megicula is the one who killed my mother

385
00:20:11,600 --> 00:20:12,780
Hear that?

386
00:20:12,900 --> 00:20:14,520
Put your big boy pants on

387
00:20:14,520 --> 00:20:17,320
The Royal just said that she's not gonna give up

388
00:20:17,320 --> 00:20:20,700
And since we outrank her, we're not allowed to chicken out, you got it?

389
00:20:20,900 --> 00:20:21,380
Yeah

390
00:20:21,380 --> 00:20:23,620
That wasn't like me, huh?

391
00:20:24,280 --> 00:20:27,940
After all, our friend's life is on the line, so I can't afford to give in to fear

392
00:20:27,940 --> 00:20:30,060
Wait, what friend is this now?

393
00:20:30,720 --> 00:20:34,060
I'll do everything in my power to make myself a Stage 1 mage

394
00:20:34,060 --> 00:20:36,800
That way I can look out for my bestest buddy, Asta

395
00:20:36,800 --> 00:20:38,200
I forgot!

396
00:20:38,720 --> 00:20:42,460
If I don't do something about this Megicula thing soon, then I'm gonna be sentenced to death!

397
00:20:42,480 --> 00:20:43,500
How could you forget?

398
00:20:44,540 --> 00:20:46,380
I guess there's no choice then

399
00:20:46,380 --> 00:20:51,540
No self-respecting Magic Knight would let a devil run wild and do whatever it wants, right?

400
00:20:51,580 --> 00:20:52,800
Well, alright! I'm in!

401
00:20:53,200 --> 00:20:55,320
I have no idea what I can do to help out

402
00:20:55,320 --> 00:20:57,140
But I'll try my hardest!

403
00:20:57,860 --> 00:21:02,960
I'll use these six months to make myself an even more powerful mage and get rid of that terrible curse

404
00:21:02,960 --> 00:21:06,220
Maybe then I'll be worthy of Lady Phenis' heart

405
00:21:06,220 --> 00:21:12,540
After we stop Megicula and the curse has been broken, I want to talk to Nozel again

406
00:21:12,540 --> 00:21:14,180
About our mother

407
00:21:14,180 --> 00:21:18,920
All that matters right now is beating that devil

408
00:21:18,920 --> 00:21:23,400
And then maybe I can understand a little more about my own devil, too

409
00:21:23,400 --> 00:21:29,400
For the sake of their futures and this world, I can't let another devil take control

410
00:21:29,400 --> 00:21:34,520
Okay, for the next six months, I'm just gonna let the Black Bulls loose

411
00:21:34,520 --> 00:21:36,060
Which means you can do what you want

412
00:21:36,060 --> 00:21:39,680
So you get to go wherever, team up with whoever

413
00:21:39,680 --> 00:21:43,020
Your only mission is to build up your strength

414
00:21:43,020 --> 00:21:46,320
Remember, this is a devil in the Spade Kingdom we're dealing with

415
00:21:46,320 --> 00:21:48,320
Train like your life depends on it

416
00:21:48,320 --> 00:21:50,000
Because I'm gonna kill you if you don't

417
00:21:50,000 --> 00:21:53,240
Now, I usually tell you to do this in the heat of a battle

418
00:21:53,240 --> 00:21:55,680
So six months should be plenty of time

419
00:21:55,680 --> 00:21:59,000
Push past your limits, Black Bulls!

420
00:21:59,000 --> 00:21:59,560
Right!

421
00:22:09,680 --> 00:22:11,680
There's no reason I'm proud of your life

422
00:22:11,680 --> 00:22:13,360
You look smart at some times

423
00:22:13,360 --> 00:22:14,360
Every night what happens

424
00:22:14,360 --> 00:22:15,940
There's no reason I'm serious

425
00:22:15,940 --> 00:22:16,760
You don't care

426
00:22:18,460 --> 00:22:18,940
I don't see

427
00:22:18,940 --> 00:22:20,520
You look smart at some time

428
00:22:24,520 --> 00:22:25,440
Cause you know

429
00:22:25,440 --> 00:22:25,520
You don't have to beء

430
00:22:25,520 --> 00:22:27,840
tutte

431
00:22:29,840 --> 00:22:31,800
What happens

432
00:22:31,800 --> 00:22:33,040
Maybe

433
00:22:33,040 --> 00:22:33,380
何度

434
00:22:33,380 --> 00:22:34,960
何度

435
00:22:34,960 --> 00:23:04,940
Thank you.

436
00:23:04,960 --> 00:23:14,340
間違いを間違いで終わらせないで

437
00:23:14,340 --> 00:23:20,440
涙を涙で拭わないで

438
00:23:20,440 --> 00:23:26,560
確信があるその心をかさげんで

439
00:23:26,560 --> 00:23:30,620
ここならもう一人じゃない

440
00:23:35,400 --> 00:23:37,260
This isn't just about us

441
00:23:37,260 --> 00:23:39,160
It's a life or death situation

442
00:23:39,160 --> 00:23:41,040
for the Heart and Diamond Kingdoms too

443
00:23:41,040 --> 00:23:43,220
Black Clover page 130

444
00:23:43,220 --> 00:23:45,780
The new Magic Knight Captain Conference

445
00:23:45,780 --> 00:23:47,500
Let's prepare ourselves

446
00:23:47,500 --> 00:23:49,540
to face that devil in the Spade Kingdom

